        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Journey into Zanzibar's lush interior to a working spice farm. Your guide will explain the history of the spice trade — how Zanzibar became the "Spice Island" — while you taste fresh nutmeg, cloves, cinnamon, and cardamom straight from the source.</p>
