      <li>Hands-on tasting of 8+ tropical spices and fruits</li>
      <li>History of Zanzibar's clove trade and colonial plantations</li>
      <li>Traditional hand-grinding demonstration</li>
      <li>Optional lunch featuring local ingredients</li>
        </ul>
